Expand the exhausted 512 MiB GPU VA arena to a dedicated 2 GiB window.

all50 repeatedly reports no addresses left for image buffers. Allocate L2 tables
for unused L1 slots 2/3; preserve all probe mappings and keep the public addresses
below 4 GiB. Physical buffer memory remains allocated on demand.

